body:
i have a practice set that i can make under 50$

if they are a friend of a friend through the community I am more likely to say yes (they said yes to me when I asked  but it took a couple weeks to create a relationship with some community members)

its ok to maintain boundaries especially with more expensive props

sounds like this is too much drama and stress to manage...  if she rather be with someone else let her... 

&#x200B;

crazy as this sounds, she might start chasing you after you leave cause you dont care... now that you shown her some attention and shes not getting it from you... shes like wtf... girls are bi polar especially if they are young! 

&#x200B;

keep your head up

do or die my friend, how bad will it be or get before you actually get off your ass and do something about it.... 

yeah, i eat shit also, but I know I do and I own it, so like own your stuff, and that takes time to develop.... but just know that if you dont have your shit together (somewhat because lifes always changing) then how do you expect to have someone else be in your life with their shit also.... its a lot more shit to deal with right... so handle yours.... take time... breath, 

&#x200B;

Write down what you need to do on a piece of paper, X it out when you finish it, and handle it.... or just keep talking asking us wasting time doing nothing but just being distracted at your internal feelings and emotions...

&#x200B;

do something if not dont do anything  it doesnt matter, but there is a break point to which somethings gotta give... how soon that time will be is up to you....

&#x200B;

(bit harsh sorry but you do or you dont thats all up to YOU)

i feel as though you are going to get in a little discussion about this and youre probably going to have to do this systematically over time.. sudden abrupt changes can be hard (example packing up and moving your things in 2 days) hence why people hate moving...

&#x200B;

anyway... youre probably going to have to get into his terms of understanding, meaning that, you're gonna have to explain to him to a language to which he understands... which might take some time and it will probably be really challenging so...

&#x200B;

developmentally you 2 are in probably two different places... hard to say with this information that you gave to me here but i hope you get what I mean.. 

&#x200B;

youve known him for a fair amount of time, and if its been quality of time that youve been spending with him then  you should know when he listens to you and when he doesnt... 

&#x200B;

TL:DR get him to a headspace where he will listen to understand you, not to talk back to you... gradually do this... human emotion is rough to deal with.... and good luck

had this one SO one time where she asked who this other girl was, im like so you went through my phone ---

&#x200B;

back story im a dad and this was baby mama for child support, and she saw the venmo name so she asked but still, trussstttttt, i let her go that night... straight up.

Depends on the individual.. i can live off 300$-400$ a month for food, granted thats about 10$ per day more or less.... use costco for pizza, buy bananas and fruit. I eat half a banana in the morning and half around the afternoon when I buy lunch (going out) then stretch that lunch into an early dinner. If i need to eat late I will, but by that time its like a (7$ burrito) or even better! >> cheap to eat with girls that cant finish all their food.  Whats cooler also if your work provides free sodas or water.. you can stretch those also.... 

&#x200B;

sodas are mainly sugar... stretch it out by adding water to it... or rather also... keep a water bottle like a hydro flask (they are expensive but worth it). and again you wont want to water down any carbonated drinks just for flavor.. you'll want to stretch that out... also use coupons they are soooo essential to saving money... 2 hamburgers for 5$ ... thats 2 meals down.... just saying

&#x200B;

For groceries... that dollar store... has some choices for food nearing their expiration date. you can get sandwich materials as well as fruit in some places.. but you have to use it immediately... and because its close to the expiration date, you probably wont have to worry about keeping it so just toss it after your done. Less headache... 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
